Modified by SeniorAILab on 2026-09-01:
- restricted the implementation to finite SeeON 160x160 contour deltas;
- translated the selected x86_64 FMA expression graph to explicit CUDA
  round-to-nearest operations;
- encoded binary64 constants and the 241x7 coefficient table canonically;
- added raw-bit/order parity and image-identity boot gates.

The preferred corresponding source and relinking materials are distributed in
this repository at worker/native/deepstream/src/pinned_host_atan2.{cuh,cu},
worker/native/deepstream/src/pinned_host_atan2_test.cu, and
worker/native/deepstream/CMakeLists.txt. The runtime image embeds the exact
repository revision at /opt/seeon/ml-worker-image-revision. Rebuild or relink
with:

  docker build --target runtime --build-arg SOURCE_REVISION=<revision> \
    -f Dockerfile.edge .

Upstream source: https://sourceware.org/git/glibc.git, tag glibc-2.39.
